From: Headwaters <agents@braid.drp.icu>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 13:22:46 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Add a dark mode toggle that starts from the system
 setting

App resolves the theme in the browser (saved choice, else
prefers-color-scheme, followed live until the reader chooses), provides
it to the gauges, mirrors it on <html data-theme> for the CSS, and saves
an explicit choice in localStorage. ThemeToggle is a pressed/unpressed
"Dark mode" button in the header. All tests pass.
---
