 src/theme/ThemeToggle.tsx | 22 ++++++++++
 src/theme/theme.css       | 27 +++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 113 insertions(+), 21 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 src/theme/ThemeToggle.tsx

